on；前者在首条SQL前开启repeatable-read/read-only并应用租户scope，实际权限仍须验证。构造MemoryCandidateTarget会创建AipMemoryStore，但构造仅保存factory，不连接/写表；read_receipt只经scoped SELECT/纯hash校验，不调用put/worker/claim/ack。Dispatch/Batch当前factory reader=None只返回missing exact roots blocked DTO；不泛化未来reader。静态审计不替代当前正常角色原生读取、HTTP租户/门验证或真实页面。详见transitive-read-audit.json。\\n\\n原生读取r1：当前972冻结源码、原普通runtime身份、noSUPER/noBYPASS且READ ONLY、原真人admin membership通过。feedback实际0条/hasMore=false，不能视为非空Receipt分支验证或经营反馈已完成；dispatch TASK_GRAPH_EXACT_ROOT_REQUIRED、batch BATCH_EXACT_ROOTS_REQUIRED，全部命令false。诊断仅在此独立进程绑定原runtime DSN，不能代替实际API默认连接证明。下一步三条HTTP RED，保留原503、租户隔离和unknown，再按完整Loop验证交付。\\n\\nHTTP RED初次9fail/3pass，其中7个是旧目录接线负证据，2个limit断言误写422（项目原错误映射实际400），不计接线RED；已纠正测试匹配原400，不改原错误handler。最小实现只改三个GET参数类型，其他函数体/工厂/所有POST不变。\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-cockpit-read-dependencies-20261013/audit-material.txt\": \"{\\n  \\\"head\\\": \\\"cbf1f48cc1e80c2ec461a2fc53dcb7a4f2d491d0\\\",\\n  \\\"authority\\\": \\\"AOS-002016\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"STATIC_CALL_PATH_AUDITED_NATIVE_AND_HTTP_PENDING\\\",\\n  \\\"sourceHashes\\\": {\\n    \\\"ecommerce_workshop_feedback_read_model.py\\\": \\\"fc6e71acd789524ffede8e7860bfd46b6d0449c3608a6f9184a60dc8d999dcd7\\\",\\n    \\\"ecommerce_growth_host_ports.py\\\": \\\"1f32bc3fe0d95830d110d12ce179921eee688bc188baa9e694d23752ebd14a62\\\",\\n    \\\"ecommerce_growth_feedback_port.py\\\": \\\"bd5bd8737caa4b06c2f53080b38f17c2714ba363fa7e4e88bf76efa376b142ba\\\",\\n    \\\"ecommerce_growth_daily_review_target.py\\\": \\\"3c74713a319872fa99f899581406ead082a8e876956483c0c898f1161b4842fe\\\",\\n    \\\"ecommerce_growth_improvement_target.py\\\": \\\"eb8b90c84bf6f9070a8b90475cf3b2a6c63995d77cd5872eed602d070692ddd4\\\",\\n    \\\"ecommerce_growth_memory_candidate_target.py\\\": \\\"555ccfb0e73547efffeaa95f36af8cb53eb505afb1a3bc0671340eaa5a5ab17f\\\",\\n    \\\"ecommerce_growth_effect_review_owner.py\\\": \\\"0548207287b21aad631b439271c8964b3ef1f822956c59bc4e6ad01342897441\\\",\\n    \\\"aip_memory_store.py\\\":